      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785555160872,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Transaction Simplification Algorithm\n\nGroup Name - Hostel Expenses\nGroup Members - Aditya, Rohit, Manish, Saurav\n\n\n1) Aditya paid Rs.800 for lunch (Equal Split)\n-> Rohit : 200\n-> Saurav : 200\n-> Manish : 200\n-> Aditya\n\n2) Manish paid Rs. 700 for dinner (Exact Split)\n-> Saurav: 200\n-> Aditya: 200\n-> Manish: 300",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transaction Simplification Algorithm\n\nGroup Name - Hostel Expenses\nGroup Members - Aditya, Rohit, Manish, Saurav\n\n\n1) Aditya paid Rs.800 for lunch (Equal Split)\n-> Rohit : 200\n-> Saurav : 200\n-> Manish : 200\n-> Aditya\n\n2) Manish paid Rs. 700 for dinner (Exact Split)\n-> Saurav: 200\n-> Aditya: 200\n-> Manish: 300",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
